# GitHub auto-requests a review from the owner on every PR touching
# matched paths (Dependabot PRs included, which otherwise request no
# one). Branch protection deliberately does NOT enable "require review
# from Code Owners": with a single maintainer that would deadlock every
# merge (an author cannot approve their own PR). Zero required reviews
# remains the decided posture (ADR-0008); flipping that switch when a
# second maintainer arrives is a change to ADR-0008, not to this file.

